1
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:10.000
Mr. Whitaker, per the court order, this property must be cleared by 3 p.m. today.

2
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.040
This is my house! You can't just take it!

3
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:22.640
You use this property as collateral for a two million dollar loan scheduled to be repaid via company dividends. Your company accounts are now empty.

4
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.640
When did you mortgage the house? You never told me!

5
00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:31.680
You were throwing parties every day. We didn't have the cash flow, so I...

6
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.680
So this is my fault?

7
00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.260
Did I do that for myself?

8
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.760
Where's the money from the house?

9
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.400
Chase said the project was a guaranteed win.

10
00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:43.880
So I gave it to him.

11
00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:47.260
The two million we gave Chase came from mortgaging the house?

12
00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:52.060
You believed him too. You were the one who said the investment would double.

13
00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:54.460
Stop fighting! We need to figure out what to do next.
